{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.NonVacuity","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.NonVacuity","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.Universal","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Category.ModuleCat.Monoidal.Basic"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.OSCat.id_unit_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.OSCat.id_unit_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/NonVacuity.lean#L65-L75","doc":"**Non-vacuity.** Over a nontrivial ring, for every unit `q` with inverse `qi` and every `t`,\nthe identity of the unit object of `OS(z, t)` is nonzero: lifting the unit datum to modules over\n`R` sends it to the identity of `R`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.unitDatum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.unitDatum","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/NonVacuity.lean#L50-L63","doc":"An oriented skein datum on the unit object: `E = F = 𝟙`, crossing `S = q • 1`,\nmixed crossing `T = qi • 1`, valid whenever `q * qi = 1`, with `δ = t * qi`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.sideways_scalar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.sideways_scalar","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/NonVacuity.lean#L41-L47","signatureChunk":0}]}